      "en": "He made the altar of incense of acacia wood. It was square: its length was a cubit, and its width a cubit. Its height was two cubits. Its horns were of one piece with it.",
      "ko": "그가 또 조각목으로 분향할 단을 만들었으니 장이 일 규빗이요 광이 일 규빗이라 네모 반듯하고 고는 이 규빗이며 그 뿔들이 단과 연하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "1bf5f12482c31b31a64786206644b8cc0766ebb30bfd6a17a8090972f4c4bf51",
      "translation_text_hash": "c27630198736e51ead9446619158b087c9a67dfb7fc92aa56d97cb5e27b4857b",
